# astrion-skill v1
goal: Show the 5 most recently used files
trigger:
  - phrase: "recent files"
  - phrase: "recently opened"
  - phrase: "what did I just open"
do: |
  Query the recents capability (system.recentFiles) for the 5 most
  recently opened files across all apps. Render as Spotlight result
  rows with file name, app icon, and "X minutes ago" timestamp.
  Clicking a row reopens the file in its app.
constraints:
  level: L1
  budget_tokens: 150
  reversibility: FREE
